      "importance": 0.0
    },
    {
      "idx": 4,
      "sentence": "The rotation of a complex number \\( z \\) around another complex number \\( c \\) by an angle \\(\\theta\\) can be achieved by the following steps:",
      "category": "adding-knowledge",
      "importance": 0.0
    },
    {
      "idx": 5,
      "sentence": "Translate \\( z \\) so that \\( c \\) is at the origin.",
      "category": "adding-knowledge",
      "importance": 0.0
    },
    {
      "idx": 6,
      "sentence": "Rotate the translated \\( z \\) by the angle \\(\\theta\\).",
      "category": "adding-knowledge",
      "importance": 0.0
    },
    {
      "idx": 7,
      "sentence": "Translate the result back by adding \\( c \\) again.",
      "category": "adding-knowledge",
      "importance": -0.09999999999999998
    },
    {
      "idx": 8,
      "sentence": "Let's denote the translated \\( z \\) by \\( z' \\).",
      "category": "adding-knowledge",
      "importance": 0.09999999999999998
    },
    {
      "idx": 9,
      "sentence": "The translation is given by subtracting \\( c \\) from \\( z \\):",
      "category": "adding-knowledge",
      "importance": -0.09999999999999998
    },
    {
      "idx": 10,
      "sentence": "\\[ z' = z - c \\]",
      "category": "deduction",
      "importance": 0.0
    },
    {
      "idx": 11,
      "sentence": "Given \\( z = 2 + \\sqrt{2} - (3 + 3\\sqrt{2})i \\) and \\( c = 2 - 3i \\), we calculate \\( z' \\):",
      "category": "deduction",
      "importance": 0.0
    },
    {
      "idx": 12,
      "sentence": "z' = (2 + \\sqrt{2} - 3i - 3\\sqrt{2}i) - (2 - 3i)",
      "category": "deduction",
      "importance": 0.09999999999999998
    },
    {
      "idx": 13,
      "sentence": "z' = 2 + \\sqrt{2} - 3i - 3\\sqrt{2}i - 2 + 3i",
      "category": "deduction",
      "importance": 0.0
    },
    {
      "idx": 14,
      "sentence": "z' = (\\sqrt{2} - 3\\sqrt{2}i)",
      "category": "deduction",
      "importance": 0.0
    },
    {
      "idx": 15,
      "sentence": "Next, we need to rotate \\( z' \\) by \\(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\) counter-clockwise.",
      "category": "adding-knowledge",
      "importance": 0.0
    },
    {
      "idx": 16,
      "sentence": "The rotation of a complex number \\( z' \\) by an angle \\(\\theta\\) is given by multiplying \\( z' \\) by \\( e^{i\\theta} \\).",
      "category": "adding-knowledge",
      "importance": 0.0
    },
    {
      "idx": 17,
      "sentence": "For \\(\\theta = \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\), we have:",
      "category": "adding-knowledge",
      "importance": 0.0
    },
    {
      "idx": 18,
      "sentence": "e^{i\\frac{\\pi}{4}} = \\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right) + i\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right) = \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} + i\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}",
      "category": "deduction",
      "importance": 0.0
    },
    {
      "idx": 19,
      "sentence": "So, the rotated \\( z' \\) is:",
      "category": "adding-knowledge",
      "importance": 0.0
    },
    {
      "idx": 20,
      "sentence": "z'' = z' \\left( \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} + i\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\right)",
      "category": "deduction",
      "importance": 0.0
    },
    {
      "idx": 21,
      "sentence": "Substituting \\( z' = \\sqrt{2} - 3\\sqrt{2}i \\):",
      "category": "deduction",
      "importance": 0.0
    },
    {
      "idx": 22,
      "sentence": "z'' = (\\sqrt{2} - 3\\sqrt{2}i) \\left( \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} + i\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\right)",
      "category": "deduction",
      "importance": -0.09999999999999998
    },
    {
      "idx": 23,
      "sentence": "We now perform the multiplication:",
      "category": "adding-knowledge",
      "importance": 0.09999999999999998
    },
    {
      "idx": 24,
      "sentence": "z'' = (\\sqrt{2} - 3\\sqrt{2}i) \\left( \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} + i\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\right)",
      "category": "deduction",
      "importance": 0.0
    },
    {
      "idx": 25,
      "sentence": "= \\sqrt{2} \\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} + \\sqrt{2} \\cdot i\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} - 3\\sqrt{2}i \\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} - 3\\sqrt{2}i \\cdot i\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}",
      "category": "deduction",
      "importance": 0.0
    },
    {
      "idx": 26,
      "sentence": "= \\frac{2}{2} + i\\frac{2}{2} - 3\\frac{2i}{2} - 3\\sqrt{2}i \\cdot i\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}",
      "category": "deduction",
      "importance": 0.0
    },
    {
      "idx": 27,
      "sentence": "= 1 + i - 3i - 3\\sqrt{2}i^2 \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}",
      "category": "deduction",
      "importance": 0.0
    },
    {
      "idx": 28,
      "sentence": "= 1 + i - 3i - 3\\sqrt{2}(-1) \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}",
      "category": "deduction",
      "importance": 0.0
    },
    {
      "idx": 29,
      "sentence": "= 1 + i - 3i + 3",
      "category": "deduction",
      "importance": 0.0
    },
    {
      "idx": 30,
      "sentence": "= 4 - 2i",
      "category": "deduction",
      "importance": 0.0
    },
    {
      "idx": 31,
      "sentence": "This is the result of the rotation around the origin.",
      "category": "adding-knowledge",
      "importance": 0.0
    },
    {
      "idx": 32,
      "sentence": "To get the final result \\( w \\), we need to translate this back by adding \\( c \\):",
      "category": "adding-knowledge",
      "importance": 0.0
    },
    {
      "idx": 33,
      "sentence": "w = z'' + c",
      "category": "deduction",
      "importance": 0.0
    },
    {
      "idx": 34,
      "sentence": "Substitute \\( z'' = 4 - 2i \\) and \\( c = 2 - 3i \\):",
      "category": "deduction",
      "importance": 0.0
    },
    {
